{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝、遠くを眺めたら\n綺麗に富士山が見えました(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いけど空は澄んでて綺麗だな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とはいってもやっぱ\n寒いのも嫌だな〜(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー難しい_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニテ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は幕張個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人が来てくれて\n本当に嬉しかったですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、長時間並んでくれて\nありがとうヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7th初個握ということもあってか\n初めましての方がすごく\n増えていてびっくりしました(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏レーンに足を運んでくれて\nありがとう(((っ･ω･)っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常連さんもお久しぶりさんも\n初めましてのみなさんも\n会ってみたいなって思ってもらえた\nことが本当に嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみなさんが\n来る前よりもちょこっと\nほっこりしたり笑顔に\nなれてたらいいなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！じゃあ私服紹介\nいきまーすヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず1,2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス:snidel\nスカート:NICE CLAP"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩は出てないかわりに\n肩と背中が透けてました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私こういう服多いんだよねヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて3,4,5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年に一度のサンタさん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Merry Christmas☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなサンタは足が遅いので\nトナカイさんにかなり\n走らせますヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中、サンタさんなのか\n赤ずきんちゃんなのか自分でも\nよくわからなくなったけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁサンタさんといったら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントですよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで急遽ちょいちょい\nまなサンタからのクリスマス\nプレゼント(物じゃないよ！)を\nしてました(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部  巻きおろし\n2部  ポニーテール\n3部  ポニーテール\n4部  巻きツイン(フード付き)\n5部  巻きツイン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は初めて着席型の握手会が\n実施されて、全員着席という\nことだったんですけど\nみなさんどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れないのでぎこちなかったかも\nしれないですが、真夏は只今\nお尻と腰がとんでもない\n筋肉痛に身舞われて変な\n動き方をしています（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着席型・通常型どっちも\nいいとこがあると思うので\nその時々によって自由に\n選んでいくスタイルに\nなればいいんじゃないかなぁと\n思います(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの意見も聞きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また12/23は名古屋で待ってるので\n来られる方は是非来て欲しいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってます(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか・まなつ・たんひめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は乃木どこ収録と\nEX大衆の取材でした(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆はゆったん・かずみんとの\n三人(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この三人の共通点といえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！20歳メンバー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(って言われるまで本当は\n気づかなかった(｡･д･)ﾉ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでEX大衆さんに\n誌上成人式を開いていただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日は来年の1/15(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また近くなったら\nお知らせするね(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタバタしてるけど\n体調に気をつけつつ\n頑張りたいと思いまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！今日発売のヤングマガジンに\n若月・美彩・飛鳥・ひめたん・\nひなちゃん・真夏の6人で\nパーティーを開かせて\nもらっちゃってます(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/12/16/0542859/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものに囲まれて\n終始笑顔でしたヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひチェックお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまたねっ♡"}],"source":"archive"}